[en.DECISION_C15_SOMBRA_STATUE]
Build Sombra Statues

[en.DECISION_C15_SOMBRA_STATUE_desc]
The mighty and fearsome king! May the crystal mold thy corporeal form, and may thy subjects forever tremble in awe of thy power.

[en.CUSTOM_C15_SOMBRA_MAX_STATUE_ALLOWED]
You can only build up to [?ROOT.VAR_SOMBRA_STATUE_MAX|Y0] Sombra Statues ([?ROOT.VAR_SOMBRA_STATUE_COUNT|Y0]/[?ROOT.VAR_SOMBRA_STATUE_MAX|Y0])

[zh.DECISION_C15_SOMBRA_STATUE]
建造黑晶雕像

[zh.DECISION_C15_SOMBRA_STATUE_desc]
伟大而可畏的王啊，让水晶铸成您的躯体，让您的臣民永世恐惧您的力量。

[zh.CUSTOM_C15_SOMBRA_MAX_STATUE_ALLOWED]
最多只能建造 [?ROOT.VAR_SOMBRA_STATUE_MAX|Y0] 座黑晶雕像 ([?ROOT.VAR_SOMBRA_STATUE_COUNT|Y0]/[?ROOT.VAR_SOMBRA_STATUE_MAX|Y0])
